# block-string-gen-folded-clip-tab-content-eof

## Input

```
key >
  x	y
  	z

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..17
  ENTRY@0..17
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "key"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    BLOCK_STRING@4..17
      BLOCK_STRING_HEADER@4..6
        GT@4..5 ">"
        NEWLINE@5..6 "\n"
      SPACE@6..8 "  "
      LINE_STRING@8..11
        STRING@8..11 "x\ty"
      NEWLINE@11..12 "\n"
      SPACE@12..14 "  "
      LINE_STRING@14..16
        STRING@14..16 "\tz"
      NEWLINE@16..17 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..3 "key",
            },
            value: BlockString {
                header: BlockStringHeader {
                    style: GT@4..5 ">",
                    indent: none,
                    chomp: none,
                },
                lines: [
                    LineString {
                        string: STRING@8..11 "x\ty",
                    },
                    LineString {
                        string: STRING@14..16 "\tz",
                    },
                ],
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

